%[text]  $G(s) = \\frac{1}{ s^2 + 0.1 s + 1}${"altText":"G(s) = \frac{1}{ s^2 + 0.1 s + 1}"}
%[text] Generate the Bode diagram using the [`Bode`](https://www.mathworks.com/help/control/ref/dynamicsystem.bode.html) function. Use [`grid on`](https://www.mathworks.com/help/matlab/ref/grid.html) to turn on the grid.
figure
% Create your Bode plot here


